WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:05.290
<i>Seth finally got inside
 the castle at Caislean Merlin,</i>

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:09.250
<i>but after entering a strange place 
while fleeing from the guards,</i>

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.270
<i>he was trapped inside a mysterious device.</i>

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:15.770
<i>Around the same time, the Knight-sorcerers 
received word of a Spectre Nemesis</i>

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:18.470
<i>appearing in the countryside 
and headed to defeat it.</i>

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:21.610
<i>Ocoho, hoping to be ordained,</i>

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:23.990
<i>and Melie,
 who wants to prove her strength,</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:28.860
<i>were surprised to see that
 the Nemesis looked just like Seth.</i>

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.520
Seth!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:42.520
Huh?!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:32.000
<b>The Spectre Battle 
-Spectre-</b>

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:29.390
<i>"The Spectre Battle."</i>

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:39.010
It's frozen in mid-air?

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.420
It must be the great Merlin's blessing!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.820
Now's our chance to—

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:44.760
Is that...

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.740
The Knights-sorcerers!

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:52.730
Two of them this time, eh?

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:57.550
Seven of you, surround the Spectre 
to prevent its escape, as usual!

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:00.980
The rest of you,
 prepare for an all-out offensive!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.930
We're putting everything we have
 into this attack!

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:04.780
Yes, sir!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.490
Let's do it! Harmonize!

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.660
Gyso—

00:03:07.490 --> 00:03:08.660
No!

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.800
We can't attack!

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.670
Please don't attack!

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:14.650
What are you—

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.820
Lord Brangoire, please listen to us!

00:03:16.820 --> 00:03:18.550
He's not a Nemesis!

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.870
Fools!

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.820
First of all, I'm the one 
who gives the orders here!

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.210
Second... uh, second...

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:30.180
Anyway! I won't stand for this!

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:32.130
I'm begging you! Just listen to—

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.940
You are excluded from this offensive!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:37.540
Return to the castle!
 You will be dealt with later!

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:38.570
Wait, please!

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:41.420
Let's do this! Harmonize!

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:42.320
Gysoni!

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.770
Gysoni!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:49.120
No... Please, stop.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.930
Please don't do this!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.310
I'm going numb.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.850
This is bad. I might actually...

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.110
I have to...

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.350
get out of here somehow.

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:31.610
<i>It reacts to movement?</i>

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.300
Hey, you puny little weakling!

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:41.690
You're scared of me, aren't you?

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:44.050
You're not even—

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.930
The Spectre moved!

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:52.680
Seth...

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.950
<i>My finishing move... Tentacle Lock!</i>

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:17.110
<i>I barely have any feeling left.</i>

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.860
<i>I have to get out of here, and fast.</i>

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:23.390
<i>That tube up there 
isn't being projected.</i>

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:27.540
<i>Is it outside the projection magic's range?</i>

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.300
<i>If I can jump up there...</i>

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:35.410
<i>My body... I can't...</i>

00:05:36.030 --> 00:05:39.730
<i>No! I can't die here!</i>

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:58.000
He escaped!

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:00.500
Quickly! Finish him!

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.650
<i>It's all right, Diabal.</i>

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:06.150
<i>He's already on death's doorstep.</i>

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:09.780
<i>I...</i>

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:13.750
<i>will not...</i>

00:06:21.470 --> 00:06:23.720
The Spectre disappeared?

00:06:23.720 --> 00:06:26.490
What's going on? We didn't do anything!

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:28.530
Oh, great Merlin...

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.090
It has to be one of
 the great Merlin's miracles.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:35.550
Calm down!
 The first thing we must do is remain calm!

00:06:35.550 --> 00:06:39.050
We don't know for sure
 that the Spectre is gone for good!

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:43.570
Half of you will remain here with me
 and keep watch!

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:44.590
Yes, sir!

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:47.550
The other half,
 return to the castle and stand by!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.930
Lord Brangoire!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:49.910
What is it?!

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:53.750
A few of our comrades fell 
when the Spectre attacked!

00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:54.940
What?!

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:59.580
Then, uh...
 Second, we... um... second...

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.010
They vanished.

00:06:57.010 --> 00:06:59.550
As if nothing ever happened.

00:06:59.550 --> 00:07:02.550
Oh, blast it!
 Assess the situation at once!

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:02.550
What's wrong?

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:03.610
Yes, sir!

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:04.370
I have a very bad feeling.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:05.490
Oh?

00:07:05.490 --> 00:07:08.190
I didn't realize it
 until they disappeared,

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:11.700
but my link with Seth is gone!

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.200
What?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:21.330
Someone's there.

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:23.810
Knight-sorcerers?

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:27.840
Yeah. They must have fallen 
during the battle earlier.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:30.090
They're dead, aren't they?

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.070
And our top priority is the horned sorcerer.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.860
I knew it. They're still alive.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:48.730
Someone rescued them 
and put them to sleep.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.230
But who?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.640
The bandaged sorcerer...

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.670
The one from Rumble Town.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:03.740
Yes.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:05.610
One of the horned boy's friends?

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.180
It's very likely.

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:21.890
O Father of the Inquisition,

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.140
founder of miracles...

00:08:24.740 --> 00:08:27.020
Punish this evil one!

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:29.900
Erase this distance!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.180
Two Thaumaturges, eh?

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.910
This is not good.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:58.650
Such fierce blades.

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:02.300
If Grimm were not protected 
by the tree behind him,

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.110
Grimm would stand no chance.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:08.300
Above all,
 if that man were not so hesitant,

00:09:08.300 --> 00:09:12.190
Grimm would have no choice 
but to counterattack.

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:18.620
Dragunov! What are you waiting for?!

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:22.570
<i>If he's a friend of the horned sorcerer,</i>

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:26.500
<i>then he saved many lives in Rumble Town.</i>

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:30.380
Surrender, bandaged sorcerer!

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.630
Huh?!

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:33.050
Nube!

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:45.760
Don't let those things get close!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:49.270
The sorcerer is probably hiding
 inside one of them!

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.660
He's gone?

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:58.910
No, he just took advantage 
of our blind spot to escape.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:09:59.910
There he is!

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.350
<i>He missed?</i>

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:08.790
<i>But a man with his skill 
would not simply miss.</i>

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.750
You won't escape. Surrender now.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.880
He can teleport
 to where his arrow lands?

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.670
<i>Nowhere to run...</i>

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:24.260
<i>Grimm has no choice.</i>

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:43.660
So you finally got around 
to using your bow?

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:45.540
Yeah.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.010
But it was too late.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:50.250
He's gone.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:57.050
<b>[The Power of Miracles] 
The paranormal power of Inquisitors called Thaumaturges.
 Different than magic, miracles are still mysterious.</b>

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.840
Blood.

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.270
Grimm's precious blood...

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:33.040
Leogon!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:36.430
Don't you dare touch Grimm!

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:40.690
I will not dare touch Master Grimm.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:43.610
Never! Understand?!

00:11:43.610 --> 00:11:46.600
Never. Yes.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:49.660
I just... wanted to...

00:11:51.130 --> 00:11:55.230
be of use to you, Master Grimm.

00:11:55.620 --> 00:11:58.950
I thought I would remove that stick
 in your shoulder.

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:05.780
Grimm feels nothing.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.930
You know that.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:14.510
Retrieve the blood from the floor
 before it coagulates.

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:18.500
Put it in vials, as always.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:20.790
Don't lose a single drop.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.760
Otherwise...

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:26.130
Master Grimm will be very angry.

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:27.760
Correct.

00:12:28.700 --> 00:12:31.980
When you've finished, 
prepare some food.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:35.770
What? Am I going to entertain a visitor?

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.520
No.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:41.780
Grimm had to put a seal
 on the other side of the door.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:45.660
Grimm will restart his journey
 from the beginning.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:51.050
Cross the great crossroads 
to Cape Valky,

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:56.370
then follow lower Cyfandir 
toward Triskelion Bae.

00:12:56.970 --> 00:13:00.050
Master Grimm,
 may I go to the surface with you?

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.170
No!

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:04.790
Look more pleased.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.180
Yes, that's right.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:12.160
You have work to do here.

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:17.020
Entertain visitors
 and look after you-know-who.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:21.070
That is the only way
 for you to remain alive.

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.310
Tend to your wound 
when you're finished.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:32.370
Yes, Master Grimm!

00:13:34.470 --> 00:13:38.880
Boy, Grimm cannot come 
to save you this time.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.870
Be careful not to fall into the hands
 of the Thaumaturges.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:50.610
<i>He appears to be dead.</i>

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:53.090
<i>The poison must have taken effect.</i>

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:56.390
<i>But just who is this boy?</i>

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.390
<i>How did he find his way in here?</i>

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:10.410
I can't feel anything at all anymore.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:13.620
Am I going to die?

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:16.520
Before I could even do anything?

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.250
Before I could learn anything?

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:22.920
Then... what was the point 
of my life until now?

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:27.530
I was bullied and called an infected.

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.050
They tied me up.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:34.900
But I made it this far because of Alma.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:41.900
I fought a Nemesis
 for the first time in Pompo Hills,

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:43.570
and it beat me to a pulp.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:50.430
Even the sorcerers I trusted

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:52.290
betrayed me.

00:14:56.310 --> 00:14:58.580
But... I still...

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:02.380
wanted to become a sorcerer 
who could protect someone.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.740
After that,

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:12.140
I felt like something had changed
 just a little.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:18.890
When Alma told me about Radiant,

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.410
I left Pompo Hills...

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:26.890
and was immediately captured 
by the Inquisition.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.740
That's where I met Doc and Melie.

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:39.810
After I got to Artemis,

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.790
that Majesty guy saddled us
 with massive debt.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.050
A lot of crazy stuff happened.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:54.340
But it was so much fun.

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.750
Yaga put me through a lot 
of hard work, though.

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:04.980
After that,
 we accepted a job in Rumble Town.

00:16:07.790 --> 00:16:11.230
We met Taj and his family there.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:20.040
Then the riot started,

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.170
and I defeated Konrad.

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.900
While I was climbing the clock tower,

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.580
I met a guy who claimed 
to be my brother.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:01.710
At the top of the tower, 
I fought her.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.180
I thought we finally understood 
each other, but...

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.050
I couldn't save her.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:35.900
I was so outraged,
 I lost control of myself.

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:40.620
Then I was defeated.

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:45.670
And after that,
 in spite of my promise to Alma,

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.790
I became a monster.

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.210
I felt like I wasn't myself anymore.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:06.600
I was so afraid of hurting someone else

00:18:08.010 --> 00:18:09.970
that I distanced myself from 
everyone I cared about.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:14.580
But...

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:23.190
I ended up hurting Melie by doing that.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.630
I wanted to make up with her,

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:40.890
but while I was dragging my feet
 and putting it off...

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:44.210
I ended up here.

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.520
If I had at least...

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:51.020
What is this?

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:54.220
Is this a part of me, too?

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.570
Let me out! Stop it!

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:05.340
Stop! No... No!

00:19:06.780 --> 00:19:08.970
No... No!

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.810
No! No!

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.490
Help me!

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:15.670
Please help me!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:24.300
Seth?

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:28.460
<i>I'm sure I just heard Seth
 asking for help.</i>

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:32.940
<i>But it doesn't look like
 anyone else heard it.</i>

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.890
Did you feel that, too?

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:35.830
Yes!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:39.040
We have to hurry back!
 I think it came from the castle!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:39.940
Right!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:42.420
<i>Seth...</i>

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.460
<i>Let's toss his body into the water.</i>

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:56.540
<i>The current will carry it
 all the way to Mor Niwlog.</i>

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.840
<i>Wait. Parts of his skin are turning black.</i>

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:03.840
<i>Oh, it's probably from the Nemesis's poison.</i>

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.840
G-Get away from him!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:07.020
Quickly, get away from him 
and prepare to defend!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:35.000
<i>What is this power
 that's pouring from him?!</i>

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:53.520
S-Stay away!

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:58.670
K-Kill him!

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:03.340
<i>Glaw!</i>

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.910
<i>Sciath!</i>

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.410
<i>Conra!</i>

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:18.660
<i>We'll do it together!</i>

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:19.290
<i>Right!</i>

00:21:20.060 --> 00:21:21.030
<i>Glaw!</i>

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.430
Keep firing!

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:30.590
Don't give him any openings!

00:21:30.590 --> 00:21:33.120
<i>Relax, Diabal.</i>

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:34.810
<i>There's no way he survived that.</i>

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:39.490
<i>We hit him with enough offensive magic
 to wipe out an army.</i>

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:41.170
<i>Wha—</i>

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:51.450
I have no choice now.

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:59.710
That was quite a blast.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:02.170
Oh, and here he comes.

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:20.730
Now... these injuries
 are beyond my power to treat.

00:22:22.700 --> 00:22:27.350
I suppose I'll have to 
take him to see <i>her</i>.

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.740
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.490 --> 00:24:03.500
<i>As Melie and Ocoho follow Seth's trail
 after his disappearance,</i>

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:08.600
<i>they enter Caillte's forest,
 from which it is said that none can escape.</i>

00:24:08.600 --> 00:24:11.730
<i>Seth is sleeping deep
 in this mysterious forest,</i>

00:24:11.730 --> 00:24:13.460
<i>where time and space are distorted.</i>

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:17.260
<i>The mysterious woman
 with the power to help Seth</i>

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>turns out to be Myr's wife.</i>

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:23.390
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>,
 "Seth in the Forest of Time."</i>

00:24:20.740 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>Seth in the Forest of Time 
-Caillte-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Master Grimm! 
Master Grimm! 
Master Grimm!</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
